        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家店絕對值得五星級好評！\n\n員工友善，環境舒適，食物更是美味無比！\n\n為了品嚐更多菜餚，我連續去了兩天！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The place fully deserves 5 stars.\nThe staff is nice, the place is cosy and the food is absolutely delicious !\nWent there 2 days in a row to try more food !",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Jean-Baptiste DUCOS",
