        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "Okay food - large choice of menu revolving around the same themes: eggs sandwiches tomatoes\nThe staff is okay the place small but cute\nTrying tks we’ve healthy food or so it claims\nMy burrito was full of liquid water coming from the eggs and tomatoes and very soggy - when I told the waitress she could not care less\nSmoothies are good but very icy\nGood place for quick brunch but overall average  food - the avocado toast with salmon ( u add the base and plus plus) was good",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
