      {
        "name": "places/ChIJfTuvzN8BBDQRmGm3zZT0TOo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rM1ZscE1NVnBoTUhnMFltd3hkV3BNUVhRdFYxRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡是享用早餐和品嚐美味咖啡的絕佳去處，還能欣賞到美麗的街景。我來過幾次，人不多，服務很友善。要注意的是，這裡只接受刷卡付款（不接受現金）。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Very good place for breakfast and awesome coffee. Including the nice view on the street. Been here few times, not crowded and friendly. Pay attention only accept card payments (no cash).",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Crafty Fever",
