        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21rM1ZscE1NVnBoTUhnMFltd3hkV3BNUVhRdFYxRRAB!2m1!1s0x340401dfccaf3b7d:0xea4cf494cdb76998"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJfTuvzN8BBDQRmGm3zZT0TOo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ac2N6SjVSVUpKTm5rdFdYTkpUVWRNYlVGZmIyYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "餐廳環境優美，服務一流，食物更是美味無比。飲品口感也很好，與餐廳的裝潢相得益彰，堪稱完美。巴西莓碗真的太好吃了，我一直在香港找一家好吃的巴西莓碗店，感謝上帝讓我偶然發現了這家天堂般的餐廳。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Lovely restaurant, great service, food is AmaZing. Drink tastes good and it matches the prettiness so its perfect. Acai bowl is sooo good i've been trying to find an acai place in hk and thank god i stumbled into this heaven.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "joanna c. mckuchie",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111542638361583223594/reviews",
