        },
        "publishTime": "2026-08-16T09:04:56.263078276Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ac2N6SjVSVUpKTm5rdFdYTkpUVWRNYlVGZmIyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ac2N6SjVSVUpKTm5rdFdYTkpUVWRNYlVGZmIyYxAB!2m1!1s0x340401dfccaf3b7d:0xea4cf494cdb76998"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJfTuvzN8BBDQRmGm3zZT0TOo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKMU1tbEhOMXBaVDB0c1lWa3hha2MxVlhBM09GRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡的食物絕對美味，價格也很實惠。雞腿、咖哩花椰菜和煎西蘭花都非常棒，而且分量也很足。辣味瑪格麗特雞尾酒也非常好喝。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The food here was absolutely delicious and a good price too. Chicken thigh, curried cauliflower and seared broccoli were amazing and the portion size is really generous. The spicy marg was also really nice.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
